# Secrets / signing
# The Tauri updater minisign private key — must NEVER be committed. The literal
# `~` folder catches the case where `tauri signer generate -w ~/.tauri/...` was
# run in a shell that didn't expand `~` (creates a folder called "~" in cwd).
~/
.tauri/
*.key
*.key.pub
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
